有究極異獸、悖論寶可夢與傳說寶可夢</strong>！<strong>巴西獨一無二！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>成為 Cobblemon 最佳社群的一員：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fplanetacobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord.com/planetacobblemon</a></span>！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>瀏覽我們的社交媒體：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetacobblemon.com.br%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetaCobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540planetacobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TikTok</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fplanetacobblemon%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Instagram</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>注意：此模組包主要供葡萄牙語使用者使用，但也歡迎其他語言的玩家加入遊玩。</strong></p>",
